1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
一碗热牛奶，20秒变成布丁
Hot milk sets like pudding in 20 seconds.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,700
秘密，是一勺姜汁
The secret: one spoon of ginger juice.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,100
姜里有一种蛋白酶
Ginger carries a natural enzyme.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,500
它让牛奶蛋白"结成网"
It makes milk protein knit into a net.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,900
但温度要卡在60到70度
But only between 60 and 70°C.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,300
太烫，酶就死了，撞不成
Too hot, the enzyme dies — no curd.

7
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,700
要"撞"——牛奶冲进姜汁
You "slam" the milk into the ginger.

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,100
冲完别搅，静静地等
Then don't stir — just wait.

9
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,500
20秒，表面能立住一勺
In 20s, a spoon stands on top.

10
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,300
广州番禺沙湾，撞了上百年
Perfected in Shawan, Guangzhou.

11
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,700
一碗能"凝固"的化学魔术
A bowl of edible chemistry.

12
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,200
你敢喝有姜味的牛奶吗？
Would you drink ginger-flavored milk?

13
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,700
完结篇：广东人消暑的那碗绿豆
Finale: the mung bean that beats the heat.
